expression: "query(Deal::query().where_in(Deal::STAGE,\nVec::<Stage>::new()).or_where_not_in(Deal::STAGE, Vec::<Stage>::new()))"
---
PostgreSQL: SELECT "deals"."id", "deals"."company_id", "deals"."title", "deals"."amount_cents", "deals"."stage", "deals"."tags", "deals"."closed_at", "deals"."created_at", "deals"."updated_at", "deals"."deleted_at" FROM "deals" WHERE ((1 = 0) OR (1 = 1)) AND "deals"."deleted_at" IS NULL
